{"unit_id":"heartmove__dsh-side-chat#feature-1","repo":"heartmove/dsh-side-chat","commit":"dd9dbb481cce16128a9e39966ae5e744e422160d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-side-chat-plus** 的功能「从选中文本提问」：在主会话选中消息文字后，可新建侧聊或继续当前激活的侧聊；设置为立即发送时选中文本会直接作为问题发送，也可先暂存到输入框。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:675-754"]}
